<!-- What We Offer -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Our Taping & Jointing Services</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Taping and jointing is the modern alternative to wet plastering. Instead of applying wet plaster over plasterboard joints, our skilled technicians apply jointing compound and paper tape to create an invisible, crack-resistant seam. The result is a perfectly smooth wall or ceiling that is ready for painting or wallpapering in a fraction of the time.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Inspect and prepare all board joints and screw holes</li>
  <li>Apply jointing tape and first coat of compound</li>
  <li>Second and third coats for seamless blending</li>
  <li>Sanding to a smooth, paint-ready finish</li>
  <li>Corner bead installation for crisp edges</li>
  <li>Bulkhead and complex shape jointing</li>
  <li>Final inspection and site cleanup</li>
  <li>Paint-ready surface handover</li>
</ul>

<!-- Why Choose Us -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Taping & Jointing?</h2>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>Faster than plastering:</strong> Taping and jointing is significantly faster than wet plastering, with no lengthy drying times. Rooms are ready for decoration in days, not weeks.</li>
  <li><strong>Cleaner process:</strong> Jointing compound produces minimal dust during application and no wet plaster mess. We use dust extraction for sanding to keep your property clean.</li>
  <li><strong>Crack-resistant finish:</strong> Properly taped joints are flexible and move with the building, preventing the cracking that can occur as wet plaster dries and shrinks.</li>
  <li><strong>Cost-effective:</strong> Less labour and material than full plastering, making it ideal for large areas and commercial projects.</li>
  <li><strong>Professional results:</strong> Our skilled finishers achieve a flawless surface that is indistinguishable from plastered walls and ready for painting or wallpapering.</li>
</ul>

<!-- Materials -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Materials & Specifications</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">We use professional-grade materials to ensure a durable, crack-resistant finish on every project.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
